  "boundary":"This programme discovers FDA establishment-registration and device-listing representations. FDA explicitly states that registration or listing does not denote approval, clearance or authorization. The openFDA v0.1 surface does not expose a stable exact listing-number field, so the programme uses a conservative provider representation identity and does not treat it as exact device identity. Product codes, proprietary names, K/PMA references, establishment registration and owner/operator identifiers remain scoped linkage/status evidence requiring human resolution."
